{'symbol': 'MDLZ', 'date': '2021-03-09 09:05:00', 'title': 'MONDELĒZ INTERNATIONAL ACQUIRES AUSTRALIAN PREMIUM CRACKER COMPANY GOURMET FOOD HOLDINGS', 'text': 'CHICAGO, MARCH 09, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MONDELĒZ INTERNATIONAL (NASDAQ: MDLZ) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE GOURMET FOOD HOLDINGS PTY LTD, A LEADING AUSTRALIAN FOOD COMPANY WITH A STRONG POSITION IN THE ATTRACTIVE PREMIUM BISCUIT AND CRACKER CATEGORY. TERMS OF THE TRANSACTION WERE NOT DISCLOSED.'}